{"ts": "2026-08-24T05:51:52Z", "kind": "modified", "patch_id": "cn-2025-07-25-1", "site": "cn", "date": "2025-07-25", "title": "《守望先锋》补丁说明——2025年7月25日", "url": "https://ow.blizzard.cn/news/patch-notes/live/2025/07/", "diff": [{"path": "sections[0]", "old": null, "new": {"type": "generic_update", "title": "平衡性在线修正更新", "role": null, "description": "本次更新为角斗领域平衡性在线修正。2025年7月23日更新后的回放代码仍然可用。", "dev": null, "heroes": [], "blocks": [], "maps": []}}, {"path": "sections[1]", "old": null, "new": {"type": "generic_update", "title": "角斗领域更新", "role": null, "description": "角斗领域更新", "dev": null, "heroes": [], "blocks": [], "maps": []}}, {"path": "sections[2]", "old": null, "new": {"type": "hero_update", "title": "重装", "role": "tank", "description": null, "dev": null, "heroes": [{"slug": "d-va", "name_en": "D.Va", "name_cn": "D.Va", "role": "tank", "icon": "https://ld5.res.netease.com/images/20250321/1742550489107_af2814926f.png", "dev_note": "开发者评论：“微型飞弹”搭配提供的伤害输出既高又持久，不论是爆发伤害还是长时间战斗中的表现都超出了预期。本次更新对其进行了削弱，让它与其他搭配选项的水准齐平，同时又保留了这套搭配的核心打法和影响力。", "general": [], "perks": [], "abilities": [], "stadium_items": [{"name_en": null, "name_cn": "反制措施", "rarity": null, "kind": "power", "status": "changed", "lines_en": [], "lines_cn": ["要求抵挡的伤害从100提高到150。"], "raw_text": ["反制措施——异能"]}]}], "blocks": [], "maps": []}}, {"path": "sections[3]", "old": null, "new": {"type": "hero_update", "title": "输出", "role": "damage", "description": null, "dev": null, "heroes": [{"slug": "freja", "name_en": "Freja", "name_cn": "弗蕾娅", "role": "damage", "icon": "https://ld5.res.netease.com/images/20250321/1742550515405_dc13cc1ac1.png", "dev_note": "开发者评论：弗蕾娅的“流星索”搭配表现一直不够给力，特别是与弗蕾娅有统治级表现的武器强度流搭配相比。我们决定提升相关异能的威力，增强弗蕾娅的搭配多样化。", "general": [], "perks": [], "abilities": [], "stadium_items": [{"name_en": null, "name_cn": "小型缚索", "rarity": null, "kind": "power", "status": "changed", "lines_en": [], "lines_cn": ["效果降低从50%降低至40%。"], "raw_text": ["小型缚索——异能"]}, {"name_en": null, "name_cn": "流星天劫", "rarity": null, "kind": "power", "status": "changed", "lines_en": [], "lines_cn": ["持续时间从2秒延长至3秒。"], "raw_text": ["流星天劫——异能"]}]}, {"slug": "mei", "name_en": "Mei", "name_cn": "美", "role": "damage", "icon": "https://ld5.res.netease.com/images/20250321/1742550490449_12cabd9351.png", "dev_note": "开发者评论：“减速雪球”干扰敌人的效果非常优秀，但减速效果不仅过于强大，且十分容易施加。我们决定削弱减速的效果，使其不那么具有压倒性优势，但当美进行精确射击和巧妙使用辅助攻击模式时，依然能达到非常不错的效果。", "general": [], "perks": [], "abilities": [], "stadium_items": [{"name_en": null, "name_cn": "减速雪球", "rarity": null, "kind": "power", "status": "changed", "lines_en": [], "lines_cn": ["减速效果从30%降低至15%。"], "raw_text": ["减速雪球——异能"]}]}], "blocks": [], "maps": []}}, {"path": "sections[4]", "old": null, "new": {"type": "hero_update", "title": "支援", "role": "support", "description": null, "dev": null, "heroes": [{"slug": "juno", "name_en": "Juno", "name_cn": "朱诺", "role": "support", "icon": "https://ld5.res.netease.com/images/20250321/1742550519856_21b6bf24c2.png", "dev_note": "开发者评论：对于强调暴击的搭配来说，“医疗精锐”的效果并没能达到预期。本次增强主要是提升这个异能的暴击倍率，让精确操作的收益更大，也是对高端玩家的高风险高回报玩法风格的重大回馈。", "general": [], "perks": [], "abilities": [], "stadium_items": [{"name_en": null, "name_cn": "医疗精锐", "rarity": null, "kind": "power", "status": "changed", "lines_en": [], "lines_cn": ["暴击倍率从1.25提高至1.5。"], "raw_text": ["医疗精锐——异能"]}]}], "blocks": [], "maps": []}}]}
